{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1790646060, "covers_from": "2026-09-29T01:41:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-09-29T01:42:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1790646120, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-09-29T01:41:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 12, "queue_number": 53257, "sprite_key": "deer_culture", "district": "songshan", "topic": "觀光", "content": "台北市很多小黃都不提供刷卡，覺得這樣是計程車產業的惡性循環！而且觀感不佳", "display_name": "松山代表 No.53,257", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": false}, {"starts_at": "2026-09-29T01:41:12+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 34670, "sprite_key": "squirrel_oldtown", "district": "zhongzheng", "topic": "交通", "content": "不要再亂畫人行道線，很多有人行道的地方還多畫人行道出來，想惡意讓市民在危險擁擠中違規，騙取罰金。", "display_name": "中正代表 No.34,670", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-09-29T01:41:27+00:00", "duration_seconds": 11, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 48109, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_culture", "district": "zhongshan", "topic": "環境", "content": "真的很討厭路上抽煙的人，煙會飄，躲哪都不是，為什麼我要吸到二手煙。", "display_name": "中山代表 No.48,109", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-09-29T01:41:38+00:00", "duration_seconds": 6, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 16003, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "環境", "content": "看到很多長很大的樹被砍掉，很心痛啊！", "display_name": "大安代表 No.16,003", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-09-29T01:41:44+00:00", "duration_seconds": 16, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 4840, "sprite_key": "deer_business", "district": "xinyi", "topic": "其他", "content": "很多房東會要求不能申請租屋補助，甚至會要租客簽署不租補的條款，讓租補看得到申請不到", "display_name": "信義代表 No.4,840", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 34670, "sprite_key": "squirrel_oldtown", "display_name": "中正代表 No.34,670", "district": "zhongzheng", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 48109, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_culture", "display_name": "中山代表 No.48,109", "district": "zhongshan", "is_replay": tr